# Strip dev/devDependency-only modules from the .vsix.
#
# We don't ship any node_modules:
#  - @github/copilot-sdk + @github/copilot CLI together total ~250 MB of
#    multi-platform native binaries. The Copilot backend lazy-`require`s the
#    SDK (declared as an optional peerDependency); users opting in install
#    `@github/copilot` globally and we resolve it from there.
#  - zod is bundled into out/extension.js by webpack.
#  - vscode-jsonrpc is a transitive of the SDK; lives wherever the SDK does.
node_modules/**
